# Typing Velocity — cloud configuration (see README-CLOUD.md)
# This project is a no-build static site, so these values live in
# config.js. This file documents them in env-var form for any future
# bundler/CI deployment that injects environment variables.
#
# PUBLIC client credentials (safe for browsers — RLS enforces security):
SUPABASE_URL=https://YOURPROJECT.supabase.co
SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your-anon-public-key
#
# NEVER commit or expose the service_role key anywhere client-side.
